  "conversion": {
    "blender": "4.5.9",
    "gltfTransform": "4.2.1",
    "changes": [
      "Extracted device bodies and a separate Magic Keyboard accessory; excluded unrelated parts and presentation duplicates.",
      "Normalized conventional device portrait axes, centered their screen and uniformly scaled its height to 2.2 scene units. The Duo retains its upstream centimeter hinge rig.",
      "Replaced the baked marketing screen with a named placeholder for the live framebuffer.",
      "Resized textures to at most 1024 pixels and encoded them as WebP; retained body geometry.",
      "Removed parts that no camera direction reaches (hiddenNodes) and pushed the iPhone 16 and 16 Plus glass shells 0.0003 units outward (surfaceOffsets) so they no longer cross the base layer beneath them.",
      "Welded vertices and compressed geometry with EXT_meshopt_compression on one scene-wide 16-bit quantization grid, which keeps coincident layers coincident."
    ]
  },
